tyle=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T5vTS6tV5DMwv1ISC7CSMOibiafXIpWL5lUAplZu7Lnd96xNDX093cicHwDc0E51XqFXcx5dOmnwWWQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 788px;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n           关于 Hacienda Cañas Verdes &amp; ABU\n          </strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          阿布咖啡的庄园正名其实是Hacienda Cañas Verdes, 也是它所属的地区的名字，现在有庄园第五代José Luttrell负责管理运营，而庄园对外的行销都使用Abu Coffee，原因是为了纪念他的祖父，也就是庄园第三代José Guillermo Luttrell Tedman，是他对质量的远见与坚持努力，奠定了庄园现在高水准生产的基础。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SnlODiaTrnTuwU9kZrhghs3hXTwHZVTX2cJWbd7R1b85b9MSfQWjdpKiaQowmGZwqxgCD0o7hLwEng/640?wx_fmt=png\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;max-width: 100%;height: auto !important;vertical-align: bottom;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;'/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这就是为什么“ABU”（西班牙语中的Abuelo，祖父的缩写）就像他的孙子们常说的那样，代表了这位富有远见和激情的Boquete精品咖啡爱好者的愿景，农场希望为后代保留。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T5vTS6tV5DMwv1ISC7CSMONeuFg6gwVglF5IWkPUTbibM5a0vvpn8bxbWx7I25DPNJIaCpub3f3nA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;font-size: 14px;display: inline !important;\">\n          Abu Coffee以瑰夏种植为主，种植于波奎特的Cañas Verdes地区，气候潮湿，有典型的热带雨林微气候特点。咖啡树生长在巴鲁火山南面的山坡上，紧邻巴鲁火山国家公园，土壤肥沃、排水良好、来源于火山的土壤富含有机物质。庄园平均种植海拔1550米。咖啡的遮阴树由当地原生树木组成，和当地的动植物和谐生长，遵循环境和生物多样性的发展。鉴于其独特的地理位置，阳光是贯穿整个咖啡种植的关键元素。咖啡树的整个生长过程，接收充足的太阳光照，在清晨和黄昏时分被在当地称为“Bajareque”的热带薄雾所笼罩。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7T5vTS6tV5DMwv1ISC7CSMOQcoLTe1yWYib7fvErOSj7NvcHicsLf04uLssYeo5JSHXrQWHFK3F7QzA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin: 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            处理细节\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          这个批次的日晒瑰夏的处理过程\n         </span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            鲜果采收后先用干净的泉水浮选去除瑕疵果和杂质、异物等\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            随后放入发酵罐中开放有氧发酵48小时\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            然后封闭发酵罐厌氧发酵72小时\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            转移至晒床晾晒\n           </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;\">\n<strong style='font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           获奖情况\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          2017年阿布庄园首次参加BOP竞赛，以 91.52分的成绩获得第6名；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          2018年BOP，阿布庄园以90.5分获得日晒瑰夏组第12名，并且以90.25分获得水洗瑰夏组第15名；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-style: initial;text-decora